Package: swift
Type: Package
Title: Handle Astrophysical Simulation Data from SWIFT/SOAP
Version: 0.11
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Danail",
             family = "Obreschkow",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "danail.obreschkow@gmail.com",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1527-0762")))
Description: This package bundles routines for accessing and visualising 
    astrophysical simulation data output by the hydro-gravitational 
    N-body simulation code SWIFT (SPH With Inter-dependent Fine-grained Tasking),
    as well as value-added data generated with SOAP (Spherical Overdensity 
    Aperture Processor). The current primary use is the post-processing of 
    the Colibre and Flamingo cosmological simulations for research purposes.
    Within some limits, the routines can also be used to access 
    and render data generated by Gadget (GAlaxies with Dark matter and Gas intEracT).
    A mini-tutorial is provided in the package help page 'swift'. (Type ?swift in console.)
